{"title": "Google beta lets you test ‘Create My Widget’ on Pixel 10 and 11 now", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/16/pixel-create-my-widget-beta/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/Pixel-11-Create-My-Widget.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Following the <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/10/november-2026-pixel-feature-drop/\">November 2026 Pixel Drop</a> announcement, Google is <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/GooglePixel/comments/1xxv5oh/eager_to_try_create_my_widget_heres_how_to_get_it/\">letting</a> Pixel 10 and 11 owners try Create My Widget ahead of broader availability.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/16/pixel-create-my-widget-beta/#more-737795\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-16T08:39:58+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-16T20:12:00.919170+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Gemini rolling out 66 new regional voices on Android and iOS, including 10+ UK dialects", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/16/gemini-rolling-out-66-new-regional-voices-on-android-and-ios-including-10-uk-dialects/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/03/Gemini-Live-Voice.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Following a <a href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/05/27/new-gemini-live-voices/\">preview at Google I/O</a>, Google is rolling out 66 new regional voices to the Gemini app on both Android and iOS today. The expansion introduces tailored voice options across U.S. English, U.K. English, Indian English, Hindi, Brazilian Portuguese, Indonesian, and Korean.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/16/gemini-rolling-out-66-new-regional-voices-on-android-and-ios-including-10-uk-dialects/#more-737578\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-16T08:00:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-16T20:12:00.919170+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Samsung Galaxy’s next major update keeps leaking – here’s what to expect in One UI 9.5", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/16/samsung-galaxy-one-ui-9-5-update-leak/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/10/Galaxy-Z-Fold-8-v-fold-shape.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Samsung is preparing its next major update for Galaxy phones, One UI 9.5, and new details have been coming to light. Here’s an overview of <em>a lot</em> of One UI 9.5 updates that have leaked so far.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/16/samsung-galaxy-one-ui-9-5-update-leak/#more-737671\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-16T07:45:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-16T20:12:00.919170+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Samsung’s Galaxy Z Fold 8 returns to its lowest price yet ahead of Black Friday", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/16/samsungs-galaxy-z-fold-8-returns-to-its-lowest-price-yet-ahead-of-black-friday/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/10/Galaxy-Z-Fold-8-lavender-5.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">No, your calendar isn’t lying to you — Thanksgiving really is next week, and with it comes the official start of the holiday shopping season. It’s never too early to get a start on your list, though, and if you’re hoping to surprise someone with a brand-new foldable under the tree, all three of Samsung’s 2026 foldables are currently marked down on Amazon, and that includes an all-time low for this year’s hit Galaxy Z Fold 8.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/16/samsungs-galaxy-z-fold-8-returns-to-its-lowest-price-yet-ahead-of-black-friday/#more-737700\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-16T07:08:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-16T20:12:00.919170+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
