{"title": "Pixel Watch update brings a sweet redesign I wish was on more apps", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/13/google-pixel-watch-media-controls-redesign-update/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2025/08/Pixel-Watch-4-Apps-Screen.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Google has been at its gradient redesign schtick for a while now to varying levels of success, but its latest redesign has just landed on the Pixel Watch for the Media Controls app, and I love it.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/13/google-pixel-watch-media-controls-redesign-update/#more-737386\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-13T06:55:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-16T20:12:00.919170+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "Proton Pass is up to 60% off for Black Friday—and it does way more than just store your passwords", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/13/proton-pass-is-up-to-60-off-for-black-friday-and-it-does-way-more-than-just-store-your-passwords-sponsored/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/lifestyle-laptop-pass-2048x1365-1.webp?w=1500\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There’s a familiar interruption that comes with shopping online: you’ve found what you want, you’re ready to check out, and the store asks you to sign in. Was this the account with your usual password? Did you change it last time? Is it easier to reset it again?</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Proton Pass is designed to take that friction out of your day. It creates strong, unique passwords, remembers them for you, and fills them in when you log in. But it also handles something a password alone can’t: keeping your real email address out of another retailer’s database.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/13/proton-pass-is-up-to-60-off-for-black-friday-and-it-does-way-more-than-just-store-your-passwords-sponsored/#more-737123\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-13T06:15:00+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-16T20:12:00.919170+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
{"title": "This Quest 3 golf club actually improved my scores, but it comes at a cost", "link": "https://9to5google.com/2026/11/13/amvr-ga2-golf-club-meta-quest-review/", "summary": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5google.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/4/2026/11/amvr-ga2-02.jpg?quality=82&strip=all&w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The AMVR GA2 is a fresh take on a Quest 3 golf club accessory, and I was pleasantly surprised with what it did for my scores.</p>\n\n\n\n <a class=\"more-link\" href=\"https://9to5google.com/2026/11/13/amvr-ga2-golf-club-meta-quest-review/#more-736384\">more…</a>", "published": "2026-11-13T05:16:45+00:00", "source": "9to5Google", "category": "subscription", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-11-16T20:12:00.919170+00:00", "ontology": {"repo": "SubscriptionRadar", "category": "subscription", "ontology_version": "0.1.0", "evidence_policy_ids": ["traceable_url_required", "cross_reference_required", "non_authoritative_context_only"]}}
